@slimtimbodin Back then we decided not to implement a breadcrumb option / widget.

However you can make a custom widget:

```js
var search = instantsearch();
search.addWidget({
    render: function(params) {
      console.log(params.helper.getHierarchicalFacetBreadcrumb('Classifications'));
      // do the actual rendering here using jQuery or any library
    }
});
```
